---
.title = "Resolve a host name",
.date = "2024-01-01",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

`std.Io.net.HostName.lookup` resolves a host name through the system resolver and reports each
available address. Pass a host name as the optional argument; the example defaults to
`localhost`.

[]($code.siteAsset('src/04-04.zig').language('zig'))

```bash
zig build run-04-04 -- example.com
```
